MICROPROSE FORMULA ONE GRAND PRIX
Version 1.05

IMPORTANT INFORMATION!

Please make sure that you read the Technical Supplement before
attempting to connect via modem or serial link with another PC.

Detail Levels:

If you have installed the game on a 486 PC, then the Frame rate 
will be set to 15 frames per second, and all detail will be set 
ON.  This should be OK for a 486DX and below.  If you have a DX2 
then you may wish to use a higher Frame rate.

If you have installed onto a 386 PC, then the Frame rate will be 
set to 10 frames per second, and all detail will be ON, but 
Texture will be OFF.  This setup is designed for slowish 386's; 
if you have a 33mhz machine or faster you may wish to increase the 
Frame rate.  Check the Occupancy option as described in the 
technical supplement for instructions.

On a 286 PC the Frame rate will be set to 8.1 frames per second, 
all detail will be on, but texture will be OFF.
